            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>There is provided a method of operating a user equipment (UE). The method comprising: receiving a Sounding Reference Signal (SRS) type indicator from a base station (BS), wherein the SRS type indicator indicates an SRS resource set is used for a beam management, a non-codebook based transmission, or a codebook based transmission; and transmitting an SRS to the BS on the SRS resource set based on the SRS type indicator.</p>
